{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"29819","model":{"presentationWorkId":"egs:29819","staff":{"artwork":[],"scenario":[],"music":[],"other":[{"creditedName":"トリダモノ","creatorId":"egs:creator:34199","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:34199","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:34199","name":"トリダモノ","roleCode":"character-design","roleLabel":"角色设计","identityStatus":"no-alias-hit","relationId":"egs:work-creator:226949","source":"egs"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_bangumi_36074","characterName":"帕梅拉·伊碧斯","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"36074","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"11436"},{"characterId":"36074","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"138202"},{"characterId":"36074","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"19494"},{"characterId":"36074","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2250"},{"characterId":"36074","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"249447"},{"characterId":"36074","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"283338"},{"characterId":"36074","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"310881"},{"characterId":"36074","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"41265"},{"characterId":"36074","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"41271"},{"characterId":"36074","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"41272"}]},"originalCharacterName":"帕梅拉·伊碧斯","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"工作室系列的吉祥物之一。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在不同的世界观下，身世、性格稍有不同。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"--------------------------------------------------"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A4"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最早登场是在メッテルブルグ宿屋的某房间，是在那里住了几十年的幽灵。以前那个房间因为有幽灵的传说，所以没人敢住。不过，后来尤蒂入住其中，并告诉大家帕梅拉并不是什么可怕东西的事实，于是那个房间又变得格外受欢迎了起来。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A5"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"25年后，原来的幽灵房间要事先预约也变得非常困难。但随着尤蒂回到自己的时代之后，帕梅拉渐渐开始有些觉得寂寞了，表情也没有以前看起来那么快乐。她也正在寻找新的朋友。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A6"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アレーキア洞窟封印龙的祭品，后来成为幽灵后住过下水道、古堡、图书馆……虽然遇见过炼金很多代主角了、经历过很多冒险了，不过总是失忆的特性使得她仍如小白一般单纯天真。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A9"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"资料馆的幽灵，以惊吓学生为乐，剧情中加入了主角维恩所在的炼金工房，曾和现任校长是同学。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"拥有该作最强技能，而且使用门槛很低。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A11"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ロロナが拾ったクマのヌイグルミに宿っていた幽霊。悲壮感を感じさせないおっとりとした性格で後に自分のお店「パメラ屋さん」をオーブンする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A12"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"トトリが住むアランヤ村にあるパメラ屋さんの店主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何年か前にアーランドからやって来て、気づいたら店を開いていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"のんびりぽや～っとした性格で、あまり物事を深く考えたりしない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お店の管理もちゃんとできているのか、やや怪しいところがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目は若いが、年齢は不詳。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どうやら昔のことはあまり覚えていないらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A13"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"经营量贩店，DLC可加入为战斗角色。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A17"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"教会のシスター。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっとり、ほんわかとした性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常に間延びした口調でしゃべり、周囲を無意識に和ませる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"教会の仕事をほぼ一人で切り盛りしている他、街の子供たちを預かる託児所を開いているなど、わりと働き屋。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"街の老人に対しても子供のように接するなど、彼女の年齢は謎。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A18"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"為了修女研修，離開家鄉基爾亨‧貝爾，出來旅行的修女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"但是在結束修女的培訓之後，因為買了太多土產導致盤纏都花完的關係，她不得不在萊森貝格經營店鋪工作賺錢。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"總是從容不迫，也令人摸不著頭緒的個性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A19"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"キルヘン・ベルでシスターを務めていた女性。今はヴェーニュ教会で、グレースとともにシスターの仕事に励んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"キルヘン・ベルに戻るはずがなぜかメルヴェイユ行きの馬車に乗ってしまい、今は故郷に帰ることを目標に路銀を貯めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ぽわわんとした性格で、シスターとしての実力もある、教会でもかなりの人気者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A20"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在亚尔兹经营【帕梅拉的店】的女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为个性温和又带着轻飘飘的感觉，让她的店成为亚尔兹的观光景点之一。似乎是萝乐娜的旧识。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A21"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在库肯港初次登场。主线剧情后期，帕梅拉会作为旅行者在库肯港出现，并伴随一系列相关的支线任务。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A22"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作在王都初次登场。带着大量布丁，想把布丁推广到全世界。 机缘巧合加入了朵拉莉亚“盗贼”团，帮助盗贼团找到装满金币的宝箱分给了穷人们，盗贼团也帮助了帕梅拉推广布丁的愿望。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"36074"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/23/2304ac8c4bcdb34ff998c6c80281fdb7c6fa967e31baa0fc9baf2219a49d3c1e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/af/afc34afc0557da8bf2a66c4a771137c06db970ca0d77810b85834ceeddb1208e.webp","width":187,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_70227","characterName":"Ryza","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"70227","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"283338"},{"characterId":"70227","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"310881"},{"characterId":"70227","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"401192"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Ryza","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"0328"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"平凡で特徴がないのが特徴の少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"奔放で男の子っぽいところもあり、正義感が強く、自分が正しいと思ったことは簡単には曲げない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ある「出会い」によって、“いつもの毎日”に変化が訪れるーー"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"70227"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/71/71a13c44bee5148edadf94f5f4eb0aab68603c495d5dab83e762e9ebb32fa26a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f5/f51b69a414d07c8b3381227f542cc337ba74fccdbbab6ed31cadae1f076d3385.webp","width":125,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"のぐちゆり","creatorId":"egs:creator:34326","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:34326","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:34326","name":"のぐちゆり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:310881:70227:19887:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_70431","characterName":"Klaudia Valentz","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"70431","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"283338"},{"characterId":"70431","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"310881"},{"characterId":"70431","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"401192"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Klaudia Valentz","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"163"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ライザの住む村にやってきた商家のお嬢様。行商を営む父親と一緒に旅をしているため、親しい友達を作る機会に恵まれなかった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっとりとした性格だが、引けない一線を秘めており、意外に度胸も据わっている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"70431"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1b/1b69e9e7090f39361e0c5e48fde9476fe2d4f7bca70278dfb9155e62bf4d605e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2f/2f1ed60723092f5ee48486fe9bfa6f1a394e8a520fbf284ef33576615890ff2e.webp","width":130,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"大和田仁美","creatorId":"vndb:s17876","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s17876","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s17876","name":"大和田 仁美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:310881:70431:15988:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_71060","characterName":"Lila Decyrus","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"71060","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"283338"},{"characterId":"71060","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"310881"},{"characterId":"71060","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"401192"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Lila Decyrus","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"164"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"在安佩尔身边，充满谜团的女战士"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"与安佩尔一同造访拉森博登村的流浪女战士。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"充满神秘感的外表，拥有极高的战斗力，教导莱莎他们实战技巧。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"冷静沉着，不管性格还是说话方式都毫不掩饰其冷淡。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"似乎为了某个目的与安佩尔一同调查库肯岛的遗迹……？"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"71060"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0f/0f0e374954dc9fc3e33cb74c76bc33ce35147716a0e4402d0d91e1676b0e2f63.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/42/428fac5fd61f645d41ee24f4c8daf1d6f4283ff7e51bef82bbce654179e1b41e.webp","width":142,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"照井春佳","creatorId":"vndb:s7956","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s7956","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7956","name":"照井 春佳","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:310881:71060:13177:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_71460","characterName":"Lent Marslink","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"71460","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"283338"},{"characterId":"71460","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"310881"},{"characterId":"71460","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"401192"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Lent Marslink","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ライザ、タオ、ボオスの幼なじみ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"3年前、クーケン島からひとり武者修行の旅に出た。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"旅のさなかに何があったのか、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"以前の快活さは影をひそめ、荒んだ様子を見せる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"王都に立ち寄った際、偶然再会したライザたちに"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また一緒に冒険しようと誘われるが……。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"71460"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7c/7c5c4377e529f842110c200040867a1a13c829f845eeffe21ad24c28acd861df.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/83/83002da210c354df11333d20f5534f67c34590e3848568f3e57a0132e467da16.webp","width":168,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"寺島拓篤","creatorId":"vndb:s63","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s63","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s63","name":"寺島 拓篤","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:310881:71460:4906:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_71461","characterName":"Tao Mongarten","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"71461","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"283338"},{"characterId":"71461","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"310881"},{"characterId":"71461","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"401192"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Tao Mongarten","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ライザの幼なじみ。ボオスと共に王都へ留学し、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学者になるべく日々勉学に励んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"この3年でかなり背が伸び、いじめられっ子の面影はない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一人読書を好むようなところは変わっていないが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"王都には見るべきものや刺激も多いため"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"島にいた頃よりは外に出ている時間も多くなった。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"71461"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/09/096e37f75ae0af497d